data: {"id": "11992a5fb3a2439f-thinking-parallel_evidence-1313", "run_id": "11992a5fb3a2439f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "---\n\n# 本轮证据结论\n\n## 已确认事实\n\n1. **Pod 当前状态**：`Pending`（非 Running），`ContainerCreating` 是容器等待原因 (`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1`)。\n2. **根因事件**：`NoNetworkFound` — 注解 `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network` 引用了一个在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition`，导致 Multus CNI 插件无法为 Pod 创建网络沙箱。\n3. **事件频率**：`FailedCreatePodSandBox` + `NoNetworkFound` 在过去 ~82 分钟内重复出现 357 次，证明问题持续存在、未恢复。\n4. **Prometheus 指标**：`kube_pod_status_phase=1` (Pending)，`kube_pod_container_status_waitin", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788783233734, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

